{"What the game uses", "遊戲實際使用的"},
{"All", "全部"},
{"What the game uses: only the buttons that do something right now - B once Link has the sword, R with the shield, X / Y with the items you equip. All: every button, all the time.", "遊戲實際使用的：只顯示當前可用的按鍵——林克拿到劍後顯示 B，持盾時顯示 R，裝備道具後顯示 X / Y。全部：始終顯示所有按鍵。"},
{"Storage", "儲存"},
{"Internal storage", "內部儲存"},
{"Memory card", "儲存卡"},
{"Game files storage", "遊戲檔案位置"},
{"Where the game files (about 6 GB) and the game code's build go. A memory card frees internal storage; the game loads a little slower from a slow card. Changing it applies from the next start of the app: set the game files up again there (delete the ones here first to free their space).", "遊戲檔案（約 6 GB）和遊戲程式碼構建結果存放的位置。使用儲存卡可釋放內部儲存；從慢速卡載入遊戲會稍慢。更改將在下次啟動應用時生效：需要在那裡重新設定遊戲檔案（先刪除這裡的檔案以釋放空間）。"},
{"\n\nRestart LAS Recomp to use it.", "\n\n重啟 LAS Recomp 後生效。"},
{"Face buttons", "正面按鍵"},
{"Switch (by position)", "Switch（按位置）"},
{"Xbox (A = A)", "Xbox（A = A）"},
{"Which controller button is the game's A, B, X and Y. Switch: by position, as on a Switch - A is the right button, B the bottom one (on an Xbox-style pad: A and B swapped). Xbox: by the letters printed on an Xbox-style pad or handheld - A is the bottom button (Cross on a PlayStation pad). The button icons in the game follow.", "遊戲中的 A、B、X、Y 對應哪個手柄按鍵。Switch：按位置，與 Switch 相同——A 是右側按鍵，B 是下方按鍵（在 Xbox 風格手柄上 A 和 B 互換）。Xbox：按 Xbox 風格手柄或掌機上印的字母——A 是下方按鍵（PlayStation 手柄上為 Cross）。遊戲內的按鍵圖示會隨之變化。"},
{"Saves", "存檔"},
{"Import saves...", "匯入存檔..."},
{"Export saves...", "匯出存檔..."},
{"Copies the saves from a Switch emulator into LAS Recomp: choose the emulator's save folder for Link's Awakening (yuzu, Eden, Citron, Sudachi: nand/user/save/0000000000000000/<user>/01006BB00C6F0000; Ryujinx: bis/user/save/<id>/0). The saves here now are kept in save/backup-<date> first.", "從 Switch 模擬器把存檔複製到 LAS Recomp：選擇模擬器中《織夢島》的存檔資料夾（yuzu、Eden、Citron、Sudachi：nand/user/save/0000000000000000/<user>/01006BB00C6F0000；Ryujinx：bis/user/save/<id>/0）。這裡的現有存檔會先備份到 save/backup-<日期>。"},
{"Copies LAS Recomp's saves into a folder you choose - an emulator's save folder for Link's Awakening, to go on playing there (close the emulator first).", "把 LAS Recomp 的存檔複製到你選擇的資料夾——可以是模擬器中《織夢島》的存檔資料夾，以便繼續在那裡遊玩（請先關閉模擬器）。"},
{"Saves copied (%d files).", "已複製存檔（%d 個檔案）。"},
{"No saves there", "那裡沒有存檔"},
{"Choose the folder with savedata0.bin (the game's save folder in the emulator).", "選擇包含 savedata0.bin 的資料夾（模擬器中該遊戲的存檔資料夾）。"},
{"The saves weren't copied", "存檔未能複製"},
{"Between LAS Recomp and a Switch emulator (yuzu, Eden, Citron, Sudachi, Ryujinx): choose the emulator's save folder for Link's Awakening. Importing keeps the saves here in save/backup-<date> first.", "在 LAS Recomp 和 Switch 模擬器（yuzu、Eden、Citron、Sudachi、Ryujinx）之間轉移存檔：選擇模擬器中《織夢島》的存檔資料夾。匯入前會先把這裡的存檔備份到 save/backup-<日期>。"},
{"Restart LAS Recomp to use it.", "重啟 LAS Recomp 後生效。"},
{"Side bars", "兩側邊條"},
{"Blurred picture", "模糊畫面"},
{"What fills the screen around a picture narrower (or taller) than it - movies, menus, the file select, Authentic 16:9: the picture's own edges, blurred and dimmed, or plain black.", "當畫面比螢幕窄（或高）時，周圍區域的填充方式——過場動畫、選單、檔案選擇、原始 16:9：使用畫面自身邊緣的模糊壓暗效果，或純黑。"},
