{"Follows the thumb", "跟隨拇指"},
{"Fixed", "固定"},
{"Follows the thumb: the stick comes to where your thumb lands, anywhere on the lower left. Fixed: it stays where it is (move it in Edit touch layout) and answers to touches on it.", "跟隨拇指：搖桿會出現在拇指落下的位置，即左下角任意處。固定：搖桿保持原位（可在“編輯觸控佈局”中移動），只響應其上的觸控。"},
