{"Load a save file and get into the game to edit it.", "載入存檔並進入遊戲後才能編輯。"},
{"Display", "顯示"},
{"Unlocked", "鋪滿"},
{"Original 16:9", "原始 16:9"},
{"Aspect ratio", "畫面比例"},
{"Unlocked: the view fills the window, so wider (or taller) windows show more of the island - up to ultrawide; houses and dungeons keep their framing. Original 16:9: the game's own framing, with bars.", "鋪滿：畫面填滿視窗，因此更寬（或更高）的視窗會顯示更多島嶼——最大支援超寬屏；房屋和地下城保持原有構圖。原始 16:9：保持遊戲原有構圖，並顯示黑邊。"},
{"Fullscreen", "全屏"},
{"Fills the screen. Also: F11, Alt+Enter or Cmd+Ctrl+F.", "填滿螢幕。快捷鍵：F11、Alt+Enter 或 Cmd+Ctrl+F。"},
{"Show FPS", "顯示幀率"},
{"Shows the frame rate in the top right corner.", "在右上角顯示幀率。"},
{"Rendering", "渲染"},
{"Match display", "匹配螢幕"},
{"Dynamic", "動態"},
{"How sharp the 3D image is. Match display: your screen's own resolution. Dynamic: as sharp as your GPU keeps at full speed. 1x-4x: the Switch's 1080p times that. 75%% / 50%% / 25%%: a share of the display, for slower machines.\n\nRendering at %.0f x %.0f.", "3D 畫面的清晰度。匹配螢幕：使用螢幕自身解析度。動態：在 GPU 滿速執行的前提下儘可能清晰。1x-4x：Switch 1080p 的倍數。75%% / 50%% / 25%%：顯示解析度的一定比例，適合較慢的裝置。\n\n當前渲染：%.0f x %.0f。"},
{" Dynamic: %.0f%% of the display right now.", " 動態：當前為螢幕的 %.0f%%。"},
{"Internal resolution", "內部渲染解析度"},
{"Bilinear", "雙線性"},
{"How the image is scaled up to the window when it renders at a lower resolution. MetalFX: Apple's upscaler, sharper. Bilinear: plain and soft.", "當以較低解析度渲染時，畫面如何放大到視窗。MetalFX：Apple 的放大演算法，更清晰。雙線性：簡單柔和。"},
{"How the image is scaled up to the screen when it renders at a lower resolution. Snapdragon GSR: edge-aware upscaling and sharpening in one pass, made for phones. AMD FSR 1: similar, two passes (slower on phones). Bilinear: plain and soft.", "當以較低解析度渲染時，畫面如何放大到螢幕。Snapdragon GSR：邊緣感知放大與銳化，單次處理，專為手機設計。AMD FSR 1：類似，需要兩次處理（在手機上更慢）。雙線性：簡單柔和。"},
{"How the image is scaled up to the window when it renders at a lower resolution. AMD FSR 1: edge-aware upscaling and sharpening, sharper. Bilinear: plain and soft.", "當以較低解析度渲染時，畫面如何放大到視窗。AMD FSR 1：邊緣感知放大與銳化，更清晰。雙線性：簡單柔和。"},
{"%s\n\nNot used at Match display: the game already renders at your display's resolution.", "%s\n\n“匹配螢幕”時不使用：遊戲已按螢幕解析度渲染。"},
{"Upscaler", "放大演算法"},
{"Anti-aliasing", "抗鋸齒"},
{"Smooths jagged edges of the game image before it is scaled to the window. SMAA: finds the edges and blends only along them, so textures stay sharp. Most useful at a lower internal resolution.", "在畫面放大到視窗之前平滑遊戲畫面的鋸齒邊緣。SMAA：只檢測邊緣並沿邊緣混合，因此紋理保持清晰。在較低內部渲染解析度下最有用。"},
{"60 fps (generated)", "60 fps（生成）"},
{"Frame generation", "幀生成"},
{"Frame rate", "幀率"},
{"60 fps (native)", "60 fps（原生）"},
{"30 fps", "30 fps"},
{"The game's own frame rate. Auto: 60 while your device keeps up, else the game's 30 (with frame generation, 60 on the screen). 60 fps (native): always the game's 60 fps mode - smoothest on a fast device; one that can't keep up plays in slow motion, then lower the resolution. 30 fps: always the game's 30 - cooler and easier on the battery.", "遊戲自身的幀率。自動：裝置跟得上時 60，否則使用遊戲的 30（配合幀生成，螢幕上仍是 60）。60 fps（原生）：始終使用遊戲的 60 fps 模式——在效能足夠的裝置上最流暢；跟不上的裝置會慢動作執行，此時請降低解析度。30 fps：始終使用遊戲的 30——發熱更低、更省電。"},
{"60 fps (generated): while the game runs at its own 30 frames a second, an in-between frame is made after each one from the picture, the scene's depth, the camera's movement and what moves on its own, and shown a refresh later. It pauses by itself when the game can't hold its 30. Takes effect at the next start of the app.", "60 fps（生成）：當遊戲以自身每秒 30 幀執行時，在每一幀之後利用畫面、場景深度、鏡頭移動和獨立運動的物體生成一箇中間幀，並在下一重新整理時顯示。遊戲無法維持 30 幀時會自動暫停。下次啟動應用後生效。"},
{"Power", "電源"},
{"Balanced", "均衡"},
{"Maximum performance", "最高效能"},
{"GPU performance", "GPU 效能"},
{"Rooted phones: Balanced keeps the GPU a step under its top clock and leaves the phone's CPU and temperature limits alone - cooler, easier on the battery and safe on a worn one; the resolution adjusts. GPU performance holds only the GPU at its top clock (the CPU's limits stay): the sharpest picture for a warm phone, while the battery stays under 45 C. Maximum performance holds every clock at the top, past those limits: a hot phone, and a worn battery may not keep up (the phone restarts).", "Root 手機：均衡模式讓 GPU 保持比最高頻率低一檔，並保留手機的 CPU 和溫度限制——更涼、更省電，對老化電池也更安全；解析度會自動調整。GPU 效能模式只把 GPU 保持在最高頻率（CPU 限制仍然有效）：手機溫熱時獲得最清晰畫面，同時電池低於 45 °C。最高效能模式讓所有頻率保持最高並突破上述限制：手機會發熱，老化電池可能無法承受（手機將重啟）。"},
{"Game", "遊戲"},
{"Remove blur", "移除模糊"},
{"Turns off the tilt-shift blur at the top and bottom of the screen.", "關閉螢幕頂部和底部的移軸模糊效果。"},
{"Hide Hero Mode icon", "隱藏英雄模式圖示"},
{"Hides the Hero Mode emblem in the corner of the screen while playing a Hero Mode file.", "遊玩英雄模式存檔時，隱藏螢幕角落的英雄模式徽章。"},
{"GPU driver", "GPU 驅動"},
{"System", "系統"},
{"Installed GPU drivers (such as Mesa Turnip) work on Adreno GPUs only.", "已安裝的 GPU 驅動（如 Mesa Turnip）僅適用於 Adreno GPU。"},
{"The Vulkan driver the game renders with. System: your device's own. An installed driver (such as Mesa Turnip for Adreno or Mesa PanVK for Mali) can be faster or fix glitches - or be slower; one that doesn't start is replaced by System at the next start.\n\nChanges apply at the next start of the app. Running now: ", "遊戲渲染使用的 Vulkan 驅動。系統：裝置自帶驅動。已安裝的驅動（如適用於 Adreno 的 Mesa Turnip 或適用於 Mali 的 Mesa PanVK）可能更快或修復畫面問題——也可能更慢；無法啟動的驅動會在下次啟動時被“系統”替換。\n\n更改在下次啟動應用後生效。當前執行："},
{"Turnip (built in)", "Turnip（內建）"},
{" didn't start: System runs instead", " 未能啟動：改用系統驅動"},
{" (next start)", "（下次啟動）"},
{"Installs a driver package from your files: a .zip as other emulators use them (meta.json and the driver's .so), replacing the one installed before, and selects it. It's used from the next start of the app.", "從檔案安裝驅動包：與其他模擬器相同的 .zip（包含 meta.json 和驅動的 .so），會替換之前安裝的驅動並選中它。下次啟動應用後使用。"},
{"Install driver...", "安裝驅動..."},
{"Not installed: ", "未安裝："},
{"Installed and selected: it's used from the next start.", "已安裝並選中：下次啟動後使用。"},
