{"Chinese (Traditional)", "繁體中文"},
{"The game's text language, as its own system setting. Applies when the game restarts: Quit -> Quit to Start Screen, then Play. App language: this menu and the start screen, at once.", "遊戲文字語言，相當於遊戲自身的系統設定。遊戲重啟後生效：退出 -> 返回啟動介面，然後開始遊戲。應用語言：此選單和啟動介面立即生效。"},
{"Portuguese (Brazil) needs the fan translation: copy its files to translations/pt-BR in the app's data folder. Until then the game's text stays in English.", "葡萄牙語（巴西）需要玩家翻譯檔案：將其檔案複製到應用資料資料夾中的 translations/pt-BR。在此之前，遊戲文字保持英語。"},
