{"Select a binding, then press the new button or key. Esc (or 5 seconds) cancels. A button that's already in use swaps with the old one.", "選擇一個繫結，然後按下新的按鍵或鍵。Esc（或 5 秒）取消。已使用的按鍵會與舊按鍵交換。"},
