{"LAS Recomp needs version 1.0.0, 1.0.1 or 1.1.0 of the game.", "LAS Recomp 需要遊戲的 1.0.0、1.0.1 或 1.1.0 版本。"},
{"No game found there", "那裡沒有找到遊戲"},
{"That file can't be used", "無法使用該檔案"},
{"Choose your game's .xci or .nsp file and your prod.keys - or a folder with its exefs and romfs folders.", "選擇遊戲的 .xci 或 .nsp 檔案以及你的 prod.keys——或者包含 exefs 和 romfs 資料夾的目錄。"},
{"LAS Recomp can't read compressed packages (.nsz / .xcz), loose .nca files or archives (.zip / .rar / .7z). Choose the .xci or .nsp itself: unzip it first, or turn an .nsz back into an .nsp on a computer.", "LAS Recomp 無法讀取壓縮包（.nsz / .xcz）、散裝的 .nca 檔案或壓縮檔案（.zip / .rar / .7z）。請選擇 .xci 或 .nsp 本身：先解壓，或在電腦上把 .nsz 轉回 .nsp。"},
{"Opening the .xci / .nsp needs the prod.keys dumped from your own Switch: choose it in the prod.keys row.", "開啟 .xci / .nsp 需要從你自己的 Switch 中提取的 prod.keys：請在 prod.keys 一行中選擇它。"},
{"The .xci / .nsp seems damaged or incomplete, or the file chosen isn't one. Dump or copy it again and choose it again.", ".xci / .nsp 似乎已損壞或不完整，或者所選檔案並非此類檔案。請重新提取或複製後再選擇。"},
{"Choose the game itself (its .xci, or the base game's .nsp). Updates aren't needed: LAS Recomp uses version 1.0.0.", "選擇遊戲本體（.xci，或基礎遊戲的 .nsp）。不需要更新：LAS Recomp 使用 1.0.0 版本。"},
