{"prod.keys", "prod.keys"},
{"Or: extracted game folder", "或：已解壓的遊戲資料夾"},
{"Step 1: choose your own copy of The Legend of Zelda: Link's Awakening for Nintendo Switch, version 1.0.0 - its .xci or .nsp file. The game isn't included with LAS Recomp.", "第 1 步：選擇你自己的《塞爾達傳說：織夢島》Nintendo Switch 1.0.0 版本副本——其 .xci 或 .nsp 檔案。LAS Recomp 不包含遊戲。"},
{"Step 2: choose the prod.keys file dumped from your own Switch. It opens the .xci / .nsp; it's asked for right after the game file.", "第 2 步：選擇從你自己的 Switch 中提取的 prod.keys 檔案。它用於開啟 .xci / .nsp；會在選擇遊戲檔案後立即要求提供。"},
{"Instead of a game file: a folder with the game's extracted exefs and romfs folders.", "也可以不用遊戲檔案：選擇包含已解壓 exefs 和 romfs 資料夾的遊戲目錄。"},
