{"LAS Recomp can't read compressed packages (.xcz / .nsz) or loose .nca files. Use the .xci or .nsp, or the exefs and romfs folders.", "LAS Recomp 無法讀取壓縮包（.xcz / .nsz）或散裝的 .nca 檔案。請使用 .xci 或 .nsp，或者 exefs 和 romfs 資料夾。"},
{"Opening the .xci / .nsp needs the prod.keys dumped from your own Switch. Put it in the game's folder, or choose it when asked.", "開啟 .xci / .nsp 需要從你自己的 Switch 中提取的 prod.keys。請把它放入遊戲資料夾，或在提示時選擇。"},
