{"The .xci / .nsp seems damaged or incomplete. Dump or copy it again and choose the folder again.", ".xci / .nsp 似乎已損壞或不完整。請重新提取或複製，並再次選擇資料夾。"},
{"The folder with your own copy of The Legend of Zelda: Link's Awakening for Nintendo Switch, version 1.0.0: its .xci or .nsp together with the prod.keys from your Switch (asked for if it isn't there), or its extracted exefs and romfs folders. The game isn't included with LAS Recomp.", "包含你自己的《塞爾達傳說：織夢島》Nintendo Switch 1.0.0 版本副本的資料夾：其 .xci 或 .nsp 以及來自你 Switch 的 prod.keys（如果不在其中會提示選擇），或者已解壓的 exefs 和 romfs 資料夾。LAS Recomp 不包含遊戲。"},
