{"LAS Recomp needs the game's own files (the exefs and romfs folders), not .xci / .nsp / .nca files.", "LAS Recomp 需要遊戲自身的檔案（exefs 和 romfs 資料夾），而不是 .xci / .nsp / .nca 檔案。"},
{"Make sure there's about 12 GB free and try again.", "請確保約有 12 GB 可用空間後重試。"},
