{"Switch to vanilla", "切換到原版"},
{"Leaves this seed and plays the game without the randomizer. Each seed keeps its own save files.", "離開此種子並遊玩不帶隨機模式的原版遊戲。每個種子保留各自的存檔。"},
{"Seed ID: ", "種子 ID："},
{"\nLogic: ", "\n邏輯："},
{"\n\nPlay it, read its spoiler log, copy its ID to share, rename or delete it. Each seed has its own save files.", "\n\n遊玩、檢視劇透日誌、複製 ID 分享、重新命名或刪除。每個種子有各自的存檔。"},
{"Playing", "遊玩中"},
{"No seeds yet", "尚無種子"},
{"Make one with the options under New seed, then Generate seed.", "在“新種子”下選擇選項，然後點選“生成種子”。"},
{"Rename seed", "重新命名種子"},
