{"Delete seed + saves", "刪除種子 + 存檔"},
{"Spoiler log", "劇透日誌"},
{"Copy seed ID", "複製種子 ID"},
{"Rename", "重新命名"},
{"Start with Sword", "初始攜帶劍"},
{"Link starts with the sword. Off: it's placed in the world, with logic.", "林克初始攜帶劍。關閉：劍會按邏輯放置在世界中。"},
{"Start with Shield", "初始攜帶盾"},
{"Link starts with the shield. Off: it's placed in the world, with logic.", "林克初始攜帶盾。關閉：盾會按邏輯放置在世界中。"},
{"Start with Ocarina and Manbo's Mambo", "初始攜帶陶笛和曼波曼波曲"},
{"Link starts with the Ocarina and Manbo's Mambo, ready to warp. Off: both are placed in the world, with logic.", "林克初始攜帶陶笛和曼波曼波曲，可直接傳送。關閉：兩者會按邏輯放置在世界中。"},
{"Treat Tunics as Upgrades", "外衣視為升級"},
{"The red and blue tunics add up instead of replacing each other: the blue one always halves the damage Link takes, the red one always strengthens his attacks, and with both he has both.", "紅色和藍色外衣效果疊加而非互相替換：藍色外衣始終將林克受到的傷害減半，紅色外衣始終強化他的攻擊，同時擁有則兩種效果都有。"},
{"Check tracker on overworld map", "大地圖上的檢查點追蹤"},
{"The overworld map marks the checks you have and haven't done yet.", "大地圖會標記你已完成和尚未完成的檢查點。"},
{"New seed", "新種子"},
{"Seed name", "種子名稱"},
{"The seed's name (its folder). Leave it empty for a random one.", "種子名稱（即其資料夾）。留空則隨機生成。"},
{"Seed ID", "種子 ID"},
{"A seed ID holds the random seed and every option below: the same ID on the same LAS Recomp version makes the same seed. Enter a shared ID here to load its options.", "種子 ID 包含隨機種子和下方所有選項：相同版本 LAS Recomp 上的相同 ID 會生成相同的種子。在此輸入分享的 ID 可載入其選項。"},
{"Loaded: the options are set from this ID.", "已載入：選項已根據此 ID 設定。"},
{"Copies the seed ID above, to share the seed.", "複製上方的種子 ID，以便分享該種子。"},
{"New seed ID", "新種子 ID"},
{"A new random seed with the same options.", "使用相同選項生成新的隨機種子。"},
{"Items", "道具"},
{"Shuffled", "打亂"},
{"Start with stone beaks", "初始攜帶石像鳥嘴"},
{"Start with maps + compasses", "初始攜帶地圖 + 指南針"},
{"Start with all three", "初始攜帶全部三種"},
{"Dungeon items", "地下城道具"},
{"Maps, compasses and stone beaks: shuffled into the item pool, or given at the start.", "地圖、指南針和石像鳥嘴：打亂進道具池，或在開始時給予。"},
{"Bombs must be found first", "必須先找到炸彈"},
{"Bombs are an item in the pool: until you find them, shops don't sell bombs and none drop.", "炸彈是道具池中的道具：在找到它之前，商店不出售炸彈，也不會掉落。"},
{"Magic Powder must be found first", "必須先找到魔法粉"},
{"Magic Powder is an item in the pool: until you find it, none can be bought or found.", "魔法粉是道具池中的道具：在找到它之前，無法購買或獲得。"},
{"Few", "少量"},
{"Several", "若干"},
{"Many", "大量"},
{"Trapsanity", "陷阱模式"},
{"Traps", "陷阱"},
{"How many traps hide among the items.", "道具中隱藏的陷阱數量。"},
{"Up to 5", "最多 5"},
{"Up to 15", "最多 15"},
{"Up to 30", "最多 30"},
{"Up to 40", "最多 40"},
{"All (50)", "全部（50）"},
{"Seashell Mansion rewards", "貝殼公館獎勵"},
{"Which of the Seashell Mansion's rewards can hold important items: up to how many seashells.", "貝殼公館的哪些獎勵可以包含重要道具：最多需要多少枚貝殼。"},
{"Starting rupees", "初始盧比"},
{"Rupees in Link's wallet at the start.", "開始時林克錢包中的盧比。"},
{"Extra checks", "額外檢查點"},
{"Every bush on the island hides an item from the pool (about 310 more checks; bushes over a hole and tall grass stay as they are). Unchecked bushes are golden: cut one to reveal its item.", "島上的每個灌木叢都藏有道具池中的道具（約多 310 個檢查點；洞上方的灌木和高草保持不變）。未檢查的灌木顯示為金色：砍掉一個即可顯現道具。"},
{"INSANE: every diggable tile on the overworld is a check - about 5,000 more, and most important items end up buried. The first dig of a tile brings its item up; grass and bushes have to be cut first. Holes stay dug, so you can see where you've been.", "瘋狂：大地圖上每個可挖掘的地塊都是檢查點——約多 5,000 個，大多數重要道具會被埋在地下。地塊第一次挖掘會挖出道具；草和灌木需要先砍掉。洞會保持挖開狀態，因此你能看到走過的地方。"},
{"Small keys", "小鑰匙"},
{"Small + Nightmare", "小鑰匙 + 噩夢"},
{"All dungeon items", "所有地下城道具"},
{"Dungeon keys (and with the last choice every dungeon item) can be anywhere in the world, with logic. A key always opens doors in the dungeon it belongs to; with keysanity the Items screen shows each dungeon's keys.", "地下城鑰匙（選擇最後一項時還包括所有地下城道具）可以按邏輯出現在世界任何地方。鑰匙始終能開啟其所屬地下城的門；開啟鑰匙隨機化後，道具介面會顯示每個地下城的鑰匙。"},
{"Every liftable pot in houses, caves and dungeons hides an item from the pool (about 400 more checks). Unchecked pots are golden: lift, smash or throw one to reveal its item.", "房屋、洞窟和地下城中每個可舉起的罐子都藏有道具池中的道具（約多 400 個檢查點）。未檢查的罐子顯示為金色：舉起、砸碎或扔出一個即可顯現道具。"},
{"Vanilla prices", "原版價格"},
{"Random prices", "隨機價格"},
{"Every good in the Mabe Village shop is a check: the shield, hearts, shovel, bow, arrows, bombs, the seven chamber stones and the piece of heart. Buy it, or steal it (the shopkeeper remembers a thief).", "瑪貝村的商店裡每件商品都是檢查點：盾、心、鏟子、弓、箭、炸彈、七塊房間石和心之碎片。購買或偷走（店主會記住小偷）。"},
{"Trendy Game prizes", "潮流遊戲獎品"},
{"Each of the 5 crane prize spots holds a check; won spots then hold ordinary prizes.", "抓娃娃機的 5 個獎品位置各有一個檢查點；贏取後變為普通獎品。"},
{"Fishing prizes", "釣魚獎品"},
{"The fishing pond's prizes hold items from the pool.", "釣魚池的獎品包含道具池中的道具。"},
{"Rapids race prizes", "激流競賽獎品"},
{"The Rapids Ride race's prizes hold items from the pool.", "激流勇進競賽的獎品包含道具池中的道具。"},
{"Dampe's rewards", "丹培的獎勵"},
{"Dampe's Chamber Dungeon challenge rewards hold items from the pool.", "丹培的房間地下城挑戰獎勵包含道具池中的道具。"},
{"Trade quest gifts", "交易任務禮物"},
{"The trade quest characters' gifts hold items from the pool.", "交易任務角色的禮物包含道具池中的道具。"},
{"Color Dungeon Blupees", "色彩地下城的藍色精靈"},
{"The Color Dungeon's blupees hold items from the pool.", "色彩地下城的藍色精靈包含道具池中的道具。"},
{"World", "世界"},
{"Entrance randomizer", "入口隨機化"},
{"Shuffles where entrances lead, with logic.", "按邏輯打亂入口通向的位置。"},
{"Dungeon entrances", "地下城入口"},
{"Dungeon entrances lead into other dungeons.", "地下城入口通向其他地下城。"},
{"Single-entrance interiors and connector caves (two or three doors) are shuffled. Marin & Tarin's house and water entrances stay vanilla.", "單入口室內和連線洞窟（兩到三扇門）會被打亂。瑪林與塔林的家以及水域入口保持原版。"},
{"Decoupled entrances", "解耦入口"},
{"With Houses & caves: leaving a house puts you outside a different door than the one you came in by.", "配合“房屋與洞窟”：離開房屋時，你會從與進入時不同的門出來。"},
{"With the entrance randomizer on, at least one kind of entrance must be shuffled.", "開入口隨機化時，至少需要打亂一種入口。"},
{"Dungeon room shuffle", "地下城房間打亂"},
{"Experimental. Rebuilds the dungeons (all but Eagle's Tower) from shuffled rooms; boss, mini-boss, stairs and other key rooms stay put.", "實驗性。用打亂的房間重建地下城（鷹之塔除外）；首領、小首領、樓梯和其他關鍵房間保持原位。"},
{"Experimental. Rebuilds the dungeons (all but Eagle's Tower) from shuffled rooms; boss, mini-boss, stairs and other key rooms stay put. Any doorway can lead to any doorway of its dungeon. Coupled: going back through a door takes you back. Decoupled: it takes you somewhere else.", "實驗性。用打亂的房間重建地下城（鷹之塔除外）；首領、小首領、樓梯和其他關鍵房間保持原位。任何門都可能通向該地下城的任何門。耦合：從原門返回會回到原處。解耦：會通向別處。"},
{"Coupled", "耦合"},
{"Decoupled", "解耦"},
{"Coherent", "連貫"},
{"Rooms connect north / south / east / west like they look, and the dungeon map is right.", "房間按外觀連線南/北/東/西，地下城地圖正確。"},
{"Chaos", "混沌"},
{"Any doorway can lead to any doorway of the dungeon. Every room is used once.", "任何門都可能通向該地下城的任何門。每個房間只使用一次。"},
{"Madness", "瘋狂"},
{"Chaos with decoupled doors: going back through the door you came in by takes you somewhere else.", "混沌加解耦門：從進入的門返回會通向別處。"},
{"Map tracks door connections", "地圖顯示門連線"},
{"Matching letters (A-A, B-B...) on the dungeon map show which doorways connect: a pair appears once you've been through either end, and every pair of the dungeon once you have its map.", "地下城地圖上相同的字母（A-A、B-B……）表示哪些門相連：走過任一端後會出現一對，擁有地圖後會顯示該地下城的所有配對。"},
{"Shuffle instruments", "打亂樂器"},
{"The Siren Instruments are items in the pool instead of each dungeon's reward.", "塞壬樂器成為道具池中的道具，而不是每個地下城的獎勵。"},
{"Open Mabe Village", "開放瑪貝村"},
{"Mabe Village's paths are open from the start.", "瑪貝村的道路從一開始就開放。"},
{"Randomize environments", "隨機環境"},
{"Each area gets another area's lighting and atmosphere (cosmetic).", "每個區域獲得其他區域的光照和氛圍（僅外觀）。"},
{"Enemies & bosses", "敵人與首領"},
{"Randomize enemies", "隨機敵人"},
{"Enemies are shuffled around the island.", "敵人被隨機分佈到島上各處。"},
{"Include mini-bosses", "包含小首領"},
{"Some overworld enemies become mini-bosses: Hinox, Armos Knight, Dodongo Snake, Giant Buzz Blob, Smasher, Avalaunch, Rolling Bones, Cue Ball, Blaino, Master Stalfos, Moblin Chief or Lanmola.", "一些大地圖敵人會變成小首領：Hinox、Armos Knight、Dodongo Snake、Giant Buzz Blob、Smasher、Avalaunch、Rolling Bones、Cue Ball、Blaino、Master Stalfos、Moblin Chief 或 Lanmola。"},
{"Boss souls", "首領靈魂"},
{"Each dungeon boss (and the Color Dungeon's) has a soul hidden among the items. Until you find it the boss isn't in its lair: the way on to the instrument stays shut until the boss is beaten. Found souls show on the Items screen.", "每個地下城首領（以及色彩地下城首領）都有一個靈魂藏在道具中。在找到它之前，首領不會出現在巢穴中：通往樂器的道路會封閉，直到擊敗首領。已找到的靈魂會顯示在道具介面。"},
{"Mini-boss souls", "小首領靈魂"},
{"Each kind of dungeon mini-boss has a soul hidden among the items; one soul counts for every fight with that kind. Until you find it the mini-boss doesn't show up and its room's way on stays shut.", "每種地下城小首領都有一個靈魂藏在道具中；一個靈魂適用於與該種類的所有戰鬥。在找到它之前，小首領不會出現，其房間的出口也會封閉。"},
{"Defeating enemies in a row never drops a Guardian Acorn or a Piece of Power.", "連續擊敗敵人時不會掉落守護者橡果或力量碎片。"},
{"Companions", "同伴"},
{"The Flying Rooster is an item: found, he follows you. The logic counts him wherever he can stand in for the feather or hookshot.", "飛雞是道具：找到後它會跟隨你。在它能替代羽毛或鉤索的地方，邏輯會將其計算在內。"},
{"The Ghost is an item: found, walk him to his grave for its check. He no longer appears by himself after the Surf Harp.", "幽靈是道具：找到後，帶它到它的墳墓以獲得檢查點。獲得衝浪豎琴後它不再自行出現。"},
{"Marin is an item in the pool, and the desert stays closed until you find her.", "瑪林是道具池中的道具，在找到她之前沙漠保持封閉。"},
{"Companions allowed in dungeons", "允許同伴進入地下城"},
{"BowWow, the Rooster and the others follow Link into dungeons; the logic counts what they can do there.", "BowWow、飛雞和其他同伴會跟隨林克進入地下城；邏輯會計算它們在那裡能做什麼。"},
{"Other", "其他"},
{"The Hookshot latches onto any wall or object it hits, not only hookshot targets. The logic counts the gaps this crosses. Seeds made with it always have Hookshot Anything on.", "鉤索可以抓住它碰到的任何牆壁或物體，而不只是鉤索目標。邏輯會計算由此跨越的缺口。使用此選項的種子始終開啟“鉤索任意抓取”。"},
{"Fast songs", "快速歌曲"},
{"Learning a song skips its cutscene.", "學習歌曲時跳過其過場動畫。"},
{"Boss cutscenes", "首領過場"},
{"Bosses' intro cutscenes play.", "播放首領的登場過場動畫。"},
{"Randomize music", "隨機音樂"},
{"The game's music tracks are shuffled.", "遊戲音樂曲目被打亂。"},
{"Writes where every item is, to read from the seed's Spoiler log.", "記錄每個道具的位置，可在種子的劇透日誌中檢視。"},
{"Generate seed", "生成種子"},
{"Makes a seed with these options. It shows up under Seeds, ready to play.", "使用這些選項生成種子。它會出現在“種子”下，可直接遊玩。"},
{"< Back", "< 返回"},
{"Spoiler log - %s", "劇透日誌 - %s"},
{"No readable spoiler for this seed yet. Generate it with: tools/rando/spoiler_view.py rando/%s", "此種子還沒有可讀的劇透。請使用以下命令生成：tools/rando/spoiler_view.py rando/%s"},
{"This shows where every item is, plus a step-by-step route to beat the seed.", "顯示每個道具的位置，以及通關該種子的分步路線。"},
{"Reveal spoilers", "顯示劇透"},
{"search (item, place...)", "搜尋（道具、地點...）"},
{"Search the spoiler log", "搜尋劇透日誌"},
{"Checks: %d reachable / %d left", "檢查點：%d 個可達 / %d 個剩餘"},
{"Choose", "選擇"},
{"Load a save file first: the editor changes the save that's currently being played.", "請先載入存檔：編輯器會修改當前正在遊玩的存檔。"},
{"Quick", "快捷"},
{"Max out everything", "全部最大化"},
{"Every heart, item, upgrade, song, instrument and dungeon key, full ammo, 999 rupees, all 50 Secret Seashells and 5 Golden Leaves.\n\nThe hearts on the HUD update after the next screen change.", "所有心、道具、升級、歌曲、樂器、地下城鑰匙、滿彈藥、999 盧比、全部 50 個秘密貝殼和 5 片金色葉子。\n\n狀態列的心形會在下次切換畫面後更新。"},
{"Refill hearts & ammo", "回滿生命和彈藥"},
{"Refills health, and the bombs, arrows and Magic Powder Link owns.", "回滿生命值，以及林克擁有的炸彈、箭和魔法粉。"},
{"Player", "玩家"},
{"Name", "名字"},
{"The save file's name (up to 8 letters).", "存檔名稱（最多 8 個字母）。"},
{"Heart Containers (one heart each), from the dungeon bosses.\n\nThe hearts on the HUD update after the next screen change.", "心之容器（每個一顆心），來自地下城首領。\n\n狀態列的心形會在下次切換畫面後更新。"},
{"Pieces of Heart: every 4 make a heart.\n\nThe hearts on the HUD update after the next screen change.", "心之碎片：每 4 個合成一顆心。\n\n狀態列的心形會在下次切換畫面後更新。"},
{"Health", "生命"},
{"%g hearts", "%g 顆心"},
{"Link's current health, in quarter hearts.", "林克當前生命值，以四分之一心為單位。"},
{"Rupees in Link's wallet (up to 999).\n\nHold left / right to go faster.", "林克錢包中的盧比（最多 999）。\n\n按住左/右可加快調整。"},
{"Secret Seashells collected.", "已收集的秘密貝殼。"},
{"Golden Leaves for Richard.", "給理查德的金色葉子。"},
{"Red + Blue", "紅色 + 藍色"},
{"Tunics", "外衣"},
{"The tunics from the Color Dungeon: red doubles Link's attack, blue halves the damage he takes.", "色彩地下城的外衣：紅色使林克攻擊力翻倍，藍色使承受傷害減半。"},
{"Equipment", "裝備"},
{"Sword", "劍"},
{"Level 2", "等級 2"},
{"Shield", "盾"},
{"Link's sword. Level 2 is the Noble Sword from the Seashell Mansion.", "林克的劍。等級 2 是貝殼公館的高貴之劍。"},
{"Link's shield. The Mirror Shield blocks beams and fire.", "林克的盾。鏡盾可以抵擋光束和火焰。"},
{"Lifts pots and rocks. Level 2 lifts the heavy ones.", "舉起罐子和石頭。等級 2 可以舉起重物。"},
{"Bombs", "炸彈"},
{"The bombs item (bomb bag).", "炸彈道具（炸彈袋）。"},
{"Bow", "弓"},
{"The bow.", "弓。"},
{"The Hookshot.", "鉤索。"},
{"The Boomerang.", "迴旋鏢。"},
{"The Magic Rod.", "魔法杖。"},
{"Shovel", "鏟子"},
{"The Shovel.", "鏟子。"},
{"Roc's Feather: jump.", "洛克鳥的羽毛：跳躍。"},
{"Pegasus Boots: dash.", "天馬靴：衝刺。"},
{"The Ocarina. Songs are under Ocarina songs.", "陶笛。歌曲位於“陶笛歌曲”下。"},
{"Flippers: swim and dive.", "蛙鞋：游泳和潛水。"},
{"Secret Medicine: revives Link once when his health runs out.", "秘密藥水：林克生命耗盡時復活一次。"},
{"The Sleepy Toadstool for the witch.", "給女巫的瞌睡蘑菇。"},
{"The Seashell Sensor: chimes near hidden Secret Seashells.", "貝殼探測器：靠近隱藏的秘密貝殼時發出提示音。"},
{"Ammo", "彈藥"},
{"Bomb bag upgrade", "炸彈袋升級"},
{"Carry up to 60 bombs instead of 30.", "可攜帶最多 60 枚炸彈，而不是 30 枚。"},
{"Quiver upgrade", "箭袋升級"},
{"Carry up to 60 arrows instead of 30.", "可攜帶最多 60 支箭，而不是 30 支。"},
