{"Mods replace the game's files: each is a folder with a romfs folder inside, as for Eden or Ryujinx. Turning one on or off applies when the game starts again: Quit -> Return to start, then Play. A translation replaces one of the game's languages - usually US English: keep Language (Controls page) on Auto or English.", "Mod 會替換遊戲檔案：每個 Mod 是一個內含 romfs 檔案夾的目錄，與 Eden、Ryujinx 的用法相同。開啓或關閉後需重新啓動遊戲才生效：退出 -> 返回開始介面，再點開始遊戲。漢化 Mod 會替換遊戲的某一種語言（通常是美版英語）：請把「語言」（控制頁）保持爲自動或英語。"},
