{"Recompiled: the setup rebuilds the game's code for this phone from your files (once, it may take a while). Set up this way, the game can still run natively: Video > Native game code.\n\nNative: the game's own code runs directly on the phone's CPU, so the setup only copies the files - no build. An experiment. Switching to Recompiled later means building the game code then.", "重編譯：安裝時會用你的檔案爲這臺手機構建遊戲代碼（只需一次，可能耗時較久）。以這種方式安裝後仍可切換爲原生運行：畫面 > 原生遊戲代碼。\n\n原生：遊戲自身的代碼直接在手機 CPU 上運行，因此安裝時只複製檔案，無需構建。這是一項實驗性功能。之後切回重編譯，就需要再構建一次遊戲代碼。"},
