{"That file isn't a driver.", "該檔案不是驅動包。"},
{"The base release (1.0.0) stays while other versions are installed.", "安裝其他版本時，基礎版本（1.0.0）會保留。"},
{"The folder with your own game folders (exefs/romfs) of The Legend of Zelda: Link's Awakening for Nintendo Switch. The game isn't included with LAS Recomp.", "存放你自己匯出的 Nintendo Switch《塞爾達傳說：織夢島》遊戲資料夾（exefs/romfs）的目錄。LAS Recomp 不包含遊戲本體。"},
{"The game files folder was moved or can't be read", "遊戲資料夾已被移動或無法讀取"},
{"The game runs in steps of a 60 Hz clock: at 60 fps one step per frame, at 30 fps two. Auto: the game picks, as on the Switch, and drops to 30 where 60 doesn't fit. 30 fps: targets a fixed 30; actual performance depends on your device and settings. 60 fps: always 60 - where a frame takes longer, the game runs in slow motion (it can't run above 60: it would speed up).", "遊戲以 60 Hz 時鐘爲步進：60 fps 時每幀一步，30 fps 時每幀兩步。自動：由遊戲自行決定（與 Switch 相同），跑不動 60 時降到 30。30 fps：固定目標 30，實際表現取決於設備與設定。60 fps：始終鎖定 60 —— 若單幀耗時過長，遊戲會變慢（無法超過 60，否則會加速）。"},
{"The game runs on the system's driver, lighting included. On Adreno GPUs, Mesa's Turnip driver runs it at 60 fps: choose a Turnip driver package (.zip, as for adrenotools).", "遊戲使用系統驅動運行，光照效果完整。在 Adreno GPU 上，Mesa 的 Turnip 驅動可跑到 60 fps：請選擇一個 Turnip 驅動包（.zip，與 adrenotools 所用相同）。"},
{"The game's text language, as its own system setting. Applies when the game restarts: Quit -> Title screen, then Play.", "遊戲的文本語言，相當於主機自身的系統語言設定。遊戲重啓後生效：退出 -> 標題畫面，再開始遊戲。"},
{"The game's volume. 100% is the recommended level; above it, louder.", "遊戲音量。100% 爲推薦值，調高會更響。"},
{"The interface changes immediately. Auto follows the effective game language; languages without a UI translation use English.", "介面語言立即生效。自動模式跟隨手機系統語言；沒有介面翻譯的語言使用英文。"},
{"The stick stays where the layout puts it. Off: it starts wherever your thumb lands on the left of the screen.", "搖杆固定在布局設定的位置。關閉：搖杆基點會出現在屏幕左側拇指落下的位置。"},
{"The system's driver from the next start on. Restart LAS Recomp to use it.", "從下次啓動起使用系統驅動。重啓 LAS Recomp 後生效。"},
{"This GPU: %s", "此 GPU：%s"},
{"Those files can't be used", "這些檔案無法使用"},
{"Thunder Drum", "雷鼓"},
{"Translates the game's shaders with 32-bit address math, the path used for drivers without 64-bit integers. Try it if lighting, grass or text are missing or wrong on your GPU. Applies to shaders translated from now on: restart the app for all of them.", "用 32 位地址運算翻譯遊戲着色器，這是不支持 64 位整數的驅動所用的路徑。若你的 GPU 上出現光照、草地或文字缺失/異常，可嘗試開啓。僅對之後翻譯的着色器生效：重啓應用可讓全部着色器重新翻譯。"},
{"Turn on Touch controls (Video tab) to edit the layout.", "請先在「畫面」標籤頁開啓觸屏按鍵，才能編輯布局。"},
{"Turnip low-resolution Z (LRZ)", "Turnip 低分辨率 Z（LRZ）"},
{"Turnip's early depth test, a little faster. Off can fix missing or broken drawing on some Adreno GPUs. Automatic: on for Adreno 7xx and 8xx GPUs, off for the others. Applies when LAS Recomp restarts.", "Turnip 的早期深度測試，速度略快。在部分 Adreno GPU 上關閉可修復畫面缺失或繪製錯亂。自動：Adreno 7xx / 8xx 開啓，其他 GPU 關閉。重啓 LAS Recomp 後生效。"},
{"Use the system driver", "使用系統驅動"},
{"Use them in place", "就地使用"},
{"Vulkan driver", "Vulkan 驅動"},
{"Waiting for the save picker / transferring saves...", "正在等待存檔選擇器 / 傳輸存檔…"},
{"What fills the screen around a picture narrower (or taller) than it - movies, menus, the file select, Original 16:9: the picture's own edges, blurred and dimmed, or plain black.", "當畫面比屏幕窄（或矮）時，周圍區域填充什麼 —— 過場動畫、菜單、選檔介面、原生 16:9 都會遇到：可選畫面自身邊緣的模糊暗化，或純黑。"},
{"Which one, for items with several: Pieces of Heart, Secret Seashells, Golden Leaves etc. each have an index.\n\nFor Small Keys, Nightmare Keys, maps, compasses and Stone Beaks: the dungeon (1-8, Color Dungeon 9). Any: the dungeon Link is in.", "對於有多個的道具，指定是哪一個：心之碎片、祕密貝殼、金葉等各自帶編號。\n\n小鑰匙、噩夢鑰匙、地圖、羅盤和石喙：指定迷宮（1–8，彩色迷宮爲 9）。任意：林克當前所在的迷宮。"},
{"Wind Marimba", "風之木琴"},
{"Writes what the app reports (GPU, driver, errors) to lasrecomp-log.txt in a folder you choose (create one, e.g. Download/LASRecomp), to open on the phone and send with a bug report. Turn it on and play until the problem shows; after a crash, the run before is kept as lasrecomp-log-previous.txt.", "把應用輸出的信息（GPU、驅動、錯誤）寫入你選定檔案夾中的 lasrecomp-log.txt（可先新建，例如 Download/LASRecomp），便於在手機上查看並隨問題報告一起提交。開啓後玩到問題復現；崩潰後，上一次運行的日誌會保留爲 lasrecomp-log-previous.txt。"},
{"Wrong game version (needs v1.0.0, v1.0.1 or v1.1.0)", "遊戲版本不符（需要 v1.0.0、v1.0.1 或 v1.1.0）"},
{"Yes, remove v%s", "是，移除 v%s"},
{"Yoshi Doll", "耀西玩偶"},
{"substitute (Hiragino Sans)", "替代字體（Hiragino Sans）"},
{"the system's driver", "系統驅動"},

