{"The game runs in steps of a 60 Hz clock: at 60 fps one step per frame, at 30 fps two. Auto: the game picks, as on the Switch, and drops to 30 where 60 doesn't fit. 30 fps: always 30, steady. 60 fps: always 60 - where a frame takes longer, the game runs in slow motion (it can't run above 60: it would speed up).", "遊戲以 60 Hz 時鐘爲步進：60 fps 時每幀一步，30 fps 時每幀兩步。自動：由遊戲自行決定（與 Switch 相同），跑不動 60 時降到 30。30 fps：始終鎖定 30，穩定。60 fps：始終鎖定 60 —— 若單幀耗時過長，遊戲會變慢（無法超過 60，否則會加速）。"},
